==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~30 seconds<sup>400f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~53.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 30~50 seconds<sup>900f~1,500f</sup>.
**2 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 66.67~86.67 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,600f</sup>.
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A similar difficulty to an EoC 2 stage. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

